      "source": "FDA",
      "summaryMarkdown": {
       "id": 1451277120,
       "html": "<p>The FDA label for lutetium Lu 177 dotatate (LUTATHERA) states that LUTATHERA is a radiolabeled somatostatin analog indicated for the treatment of somatostatin receptor (SSTR)-positive gastroenteropancreatic neuroendocrine tumors (GEP-NETs), including foregut, midgut, and hindgut neuroendocrine tumors in adult and pediatric patients 12 years and older.</p>\n"
      },
      "testing": {
       "id": 1183672041,
